Third-party material
--------------------

evals/hook-evals.json
evals/bash-hook-evals.json

These files are adapted from plugins/shunt/evals/hook-evals.json and
plugins/shunt/evals/bash-hook-evals.json in spotify/portal-ai-plugins
(https://github.com/spotify/portal-ai-plugins), copyright the
spotify/portal-ai-plugins authors, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

Changes made: converted to this project's eval format; the threshold
changed from 350 to 600; "block" changed to "deny"; head/tail and stderr
redirect expectations changed and a head parser case fixed (marked CHANGED
or FIXED in each case's reason); cases added for compound commands, globs,
wrappers, binary files, rtk and the SHUNT_CHILD recursion guard.

No other file in this repository contains code or text from
spotify/portal-ai-plugins.
